# Default tuning applied to every build (Kokuban Kernel CI project razrfold_sm8845).
#
# Only stages that measured ZERO delta against Kokuban/abi/vmlinux.symvers.golden
# are listed here. Each other stage is kept in Kokuban/tuning/ with its measured
# result in Kokuban/README.md, so the decision to adopt one is a documented edit
# rather than a guess.
#
# The profile is graded on every build: a stage that moves an exported symbol
# fails the build instead of shipping.

# I/O scheduler (ADIOS) and TCP congestion control (BBR, Brutal).
source tuning/00-base.fragment

# Low-latency queueing (CAKE, FQ_PIE, PIE).
source tuning/10-network.fragment

# Scheduling tick 250 -> 300 Hz.
source tuning/30-hz.fragment

# PREEMPT_DYNAMIC: switch preemption mode at run time instead of rebuilding.
source tuning/31-preempt-dynamic.fragment

# NT synchronisation driver for the Wine/Proton game layer (/dev/ntsync).
source tuning/90-ntsync.fragment
